WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:33.410
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:33.680 --> 01:35.120
But why do I feel like

3
01:36.320 --> 01:38.479
you don't really want her to get out?

4
01:40.640 --> 01:42.160
What do you mean by that?

5
01:42.240 --> 01:44.240
You should know exactly what I mean.

6
01:45.960 --> 01:46.690
Lawyer Xiao.

7
01:47.520 --> 01:48.979
I have a clear conscience.

8
01:49.560 --> 01:50.280
How I treat Huihui,

9
01:50.280 --> 01:51.600
everyone knows.

10
01:51.840 --> 01:53.160
I run around all day.

11
01:53.160 --> 01:54.039
Who is it for?

12
01:54.039 --> 01:55.160
If you say that,

13
01:55.360 --> 01:58.360
you really have no conscience.

14
01:59.920 --> 02:01.160
I misspoke.

15
02:02.040 --> 02:04.040
Yu Huihui having a husband like you

16
02:04.360 --> 02:06.420
is a blessing she earned in this life.

17
02:20.720 --> 02:22.560
Come on, drink up.

18
02:22.760 --> 02:23.360
Come on.

19
02:24.000 --> 02:24.560
Okay.

20
02:24.960 --> 02:25.680
One more.

21
02:30.280 --> 02:32.440
Sister, there's definitely something wrong with Zhou Huan.

22
02:32.440 --> 02:35.240
He's just like the King of Hell posting a notice.

23
02:35.240 --> 02:36.240
Full of nonsense.

24
02:36.400 --> 02:38.440
I don't think he wants to save Yu Huihui at all.

25
02:38.440 --> 02:39.680
Even you can tell.

26
02:39.720 --> 02:42.560
The key is how much Yu Huihui actually knows.

27
02:42.960 --> 02:44.160
We don't know that.

28
02:44.920 --> 02:45.960
Are you a ghost?

29
02:45.960 --> 02:48.720
Sneaking around the door every day. What are you doing?

30
02:48.720 --> 02:50.520
You're way too hostile.

31
02:50.520 --> 02:52.520
I was thinking of discussing something with you.

32
02:52.520 --> 02:53.960
What? You want free advice again?

33
02:53.960 --> 02:54.520
No way.

34
02:54.840 --> 02:56.600
Was that guy who just went downstairs your client?

35
02:56.600 --> 02:57.460
Do you know him?

36
02:57.800 --> 02:59.160
I saw him once at Jia Xin's.

37
02:59.160 --> 03:00.720
He sings terribly. Just howling.

38
03:00.720 --> 03:02.240
He knows Jia Xin?

39
03:02.760 --> 03:04.240
More than just acquaintances.

40
03:04.240 --> 03:05.440
What else do you know?

41
03:06.160 --> 03:08.290
Information is meant to be exchanged.

42
03:08.400 --> 03:08.800
Come, bro.

43
03:08.800 --> 03:09.520
Get him a seat, quick.

44
03:09.520 --> 03:10.160
Sit. Please sit.

45
03:10.160 --> 03:11.090
Please sit, bro.

46
03:11.520 --> 03:12.920
Let me give you a massage.

47
03:13.240 --> 03:14.080
Mr. Dong.

48
03:14.800 --> 03:16.530
What do you want to ask? Tell me.

49
03:17.880 --> 03:19.079
I mainly want to ask.

50
03:19.079 --> 03:19.540
You see,

51
03:19.680 --> 03:21.540
I've been with Jia Xin for so long.

52
03:21.640 --> 03:22.520
But this bastard

53
03:22.520 --> 03:23.800
is obviously on guard against me.

54
03:23.800 --> 03:25.520
He's even afraid I'll hear him fart.

55
03:25.520 --> 03:28.040
So I'm thinking about how to make him talk.

56
03:28.920 --> 03:30.079
Think about it.

57
03:30.440 --> 03:32.960
When is Jia Xin most relaxed?

58
03:35.040 --> 03:36.170
When he's sleeping.

59
03:36.240 --> 03:38.400
Are you dense?

60
03:44.280 --> 03:45.600
I'm sorry, Mr. Dong.

61
03:47.000 --> 03:48.040
I mean,

62
03:48.160 --> 03:49.040
you have to think about

63
03:49.040 --> 03:51.280
when he is least on guard against you.

64
03:52.200 --> 03:53.660
Least on guard against me?

65
04:02.280 --> 04:03.160
I got it.

66
04:03.160 --> 04:04.000
Understood.

67
04:04.000 --> 04:04.440
Intel.

68
04:05.840 --> 04:06.320
That's it.

69
04:06.320 --> 04:07.780
What do you mean that's it?

70
04:08.160 --> 04:10.290
He's working at Jiaxin's company now.

71
04:10.440 --> 04:11.840
Does that count as intel?

72
04:16.440 --> 04:17.560
That bastard.

73
04:19.560 --> 04:20.839
He really is a fraud.

74
04:43.920 --> 04:45.320
You guys can leave first.

75
04:47.600 --> 04:49.260
Ms. Zhong, please have a seat.

76
04:55.000 --> 04:56.130
What can I do for you?

77
04:56.880 --> 04:58.440
You went to see Mr. Shao alone.

78
04:58.440 --> 04:59.040
Yes.

79
04:59.720 --> 05:00.560
I wanted Chairman Shao

80
05:00.560 --> 05:02.320
to be in a more neutral environment

81
05:02.320 --> 05:03.800
and learn about other options.

82
05:03.800 --> 05:04.840
Lawyer Qiu said

83
05:05.320 --> 05:07.240
we could clearly plead not guilty.

84
05:07.240 --> 05:09.400
Why do you always want us to plead guilty and accept punishment?

85
05:09.400 --> 05:10.520
Whose lawyer are you exactly?

86
05:10.520 --> 05:11.840
Whose side are you on?

87
05:11.960 --> 05:13.960
If Mr. Shao gets sentenced to eight or ten years...

88
05:13.960 --> 05:14.600
What about our family?

89
05:14.600 --> 05:15.400
What about me?

90
05:15.400 --> 05:16.400
Have you ever thought about it?

91
05:16.400 --> 05:18.600
What if a not-guilty plea doesn't work?

92
05:19.160 --> 05:21.000
An excellent criminal defense lawyer

93
05:21.000 --> 05:23.280
must have the mindset to break the deadlock.

94
05:23.280 --> 05:25.880
Only by completely stepping out of the prosecution's logic of guilt

95
05:25.880 --> 05:28.040
can we see the facts more comprehensively

96
05:28.040 --> 05:29.370
and protect our client.

97
05:29.440 --> 05:32.440
But I also completely understand Lawyer Li's concerns.

98
05:32.440 --> 05:34.720
Local lawyers in the local network

99
05:34.720 --> 05:37.280
do find it hard to act freely, right?

100
05:38.600 --> 05:39.200
Lawyer Li.

101
05:39.320 --> 05:41.840
I heard your father is a retired police officer

102
05:41.840 --> 05:44.440
and handled Old Shao's case before, right?

103
05:44.440 --> 05:45.400
Is that so?

104
05:45.600 --> 05:47.440
Why didn't you say so earlier, Lawyer Li?

105
05:47.440 --> 05:50.200
Then it's better for you to recuse yourself.

106
05:50.360 --> 05:51.200
Ms. Zhong.

107
05:52.200 --> 05:53.200
My father's profession

108
05:53.200 --> 05:55.800
has nothing to do with my professional stance.

109
05:57.840 --> 06:00.040
You were recommended by Director Wang.

110
06:00.960 --> 06:02.600
I'm doing this out of respect for him.

111
06:02.600 --> 06:04.280
But Lawyer Li, let me tell you this.

112
06:04.280 --> 06:07.400
I hope you cooperate well with Lawyer Qiu.

113
06:08.280 --> 06:10.540
Otherwise, I'll let him take over alone.

114
06:10.600 --> 06:12.060
Think about it carefully.

115
06:46.040 --> 06:47.900
Why is there such a big commotion?

116
06:48.520 --> 06:49.520
Sorry, Director.

117
06:50.560 --> 06:51.760
As lawyers,

118
06:52.720 --> 06:54.720
sometimes we don't deal with cases,

119
06:55.280 --> 06:56.040
but people.

120
06:56.680 --> 06:59.540
If you can't handle people, you can't handle cases.

121
06:59.600 --> 07:02.520
Lawyer Qiu is quite good at this.

122
07:03.520 --> 07:05.280
You should learn from him.

123
07:06.520 --> 07:09.280
Then I'd have to go to a drama academy to study acting.

124
07:09.280 --> 07:10.400
I'm being serious.

125
07:11.400 --> 07:13.520
This is a rare major case in this area.

126
07:13.840 --> 07:15.640
Countless eyes are watching.

127
07:15.840 --> 07:18.400
If handled well, it'll be Honghu's calling card.

128
07:18.400 --> 07:21.260
If not, we'll be the laughingstock of the industry.

129
07:21.520 --> 07:23.080
Go back and think about it carefully.

130
07:23.080 --> 07:26.010
This matter needs to be resolved as soon as possible.

131
07:28.760 --> 07:29.280
Lawyer Xiao.

132
07:29.280 --> 07:30.720
The supplementary evidence you requested

133
07:30.720 --> 07:32.159
has been obtained from the bank

134
07:32.159 --> 07:33.520
and burned onto this CD.

135
07:34.280 --> 07:35.159
Thank you.

136
08:01.080 --> 08:02.200
Hello, Uncle Yu.

137
08:02.400 --> 08:04.760
I have something to discuss with you in person.

138
08:04.760 --> 08:05.520
Is it convenient for me to come to you?

139
08:05.520 --> 08:07.280
No need. Don't come to me.

140
08:07.280 --> 08:08.940
I was just about to go find you.

141
08:09.520 --> 08:10.160
Okay.

142
08:16.360 --> 08:17.640
It's getting dark.

143
08:17.720 --> 08:19.280
Why aren't Uncle Yu and the others here yet?

144
08:19.280 --> 08:21.410
Will Zhou Huan be the one coming again?

145
08:30.040 --> 08:31.840
Uncle, what does this mean?

146
08:31.840 --> 08:32.960
What do you think I mean?

147
08:32.960 --> 08:34.640
Don't you know what you've done?

148
08:34.640 --> 08:35.520
Why is this lawyer so mean?

149
08:35.520 --> 08:36.600
What are your intentions?

150
08:36.600 --> 08:38.559
We had a good agreement when we first got here.

151
08:38.559 --> 08:40.159
Why are you acting like this?

152
08:40.480 --> 08:41.919
No, what did I do?

153
08:41.960 --> 08:43.720
Can we make things clear?

154
08:44.240 --> 08:47.680
Is it possible to negotiate with the court?

155
08:47.680 --> 08:48.920
It's very likely.

156
08:48.920 --> 08:50.160
But 1.2 million

157
08:50.240 --> 08:52.000
is too difficult for our family.

158
08:52.000 --> 08:53.360
Is it possible to make it less?

159
08:53.360 --> 08:54.680
Not a penny less.

160
08:55.160 --> 08:56.560
The evidence is right here.

161
08:56.560 --> 08:57.600
What else do you have to say?

162
08:57.600 --> 08:59.000
Lawyers like you,

163
08:59.000 --> 08:59.480
let me tell you,

164
08:59.480 --> 09:00.520
just take advantage of others' difficulties

165
09:00.520 --> 09:01.760
and find ways to cheat the defendant's family out of their money.

166
09:01.760 --> 09:03.120
No, you've wronged a good person.

167
09:03.120 --> 09:05.120
When did we ever wrong a good person?

168
09:06.560 --> 09:07.890
Alright, stop arguing.

169
09:07.920 --> 09:09.120
It's just a recording.

170
09:09.120 --> 09:10.800
I have one too. Want to hear it?

171
09:12.480 --> 09:15.240
If we pay it back, is bail guaranteed?

172
09:15.720 --> 09:18.360
No one can guarantee it 100%.

173
09:18.720 --> 09:20.800
I can only say it's highly likely.

174
09:21.120 --> 09:23.240
Is it possible to pay less?

175
09:23.560 --> 09:24.600
No, it can't.

176
09:24.680 --> 09:25.940
Not a single cent less.

177
09:26.360 --> 09:29.360
Is it possible to negotiate with the court?

178
09:29.360 --> 09:31.800
Zhou Huan, let me remind you of something.

179
09:31.920 --> 09:35.000
Interfering with judicial justice is crossing the red line.

180
09:35.000 --> 09:36.680
Do you understand, Uncle?

181
09:36.880 --> 09:39.800
That recording was pieced together by Zhou Huan himself.

182
09:39.800 --> 09:41.460
Fortunately, I kept a backup.

183
09:41.480 --> 09:42.920
Zhou Huan also told me

184
09:43.240 --> 09:46.720
that Hui's aunt was sick and needed a liver transplant,

185
09:46.800 --> 09:48.920
so she couldn't afford to return the stolen money.

186
09:48.920 --> 09:50.250
I'm perfectly healthy.

187
09:50.280 --> 09:51.680
When did I ever need a liver transplant?

188
09:51.680 --> 09:52.560
Don't you get it yet?

189
09:52.560 --> 09:53.920
You were tricked by him.

190
09:54.240 --> 09:55.240
Also, Uncle,

191
09:55.240 --> 09:57.240
At Anding Wealth Management, Yu Huihui

192
09:57.240 --> 09:58.800
embezzled 1.2 million.

193
09:58.800 --> 10:00.680
Zhou Huan didn't tell you about this either, did he?

194
10:00.680 --> 10:02.480
That money should still be with Zhou Huan.

195
10:02.480 --> 10:04.480
That's why I asked you to come today.

196
10:04.600 --> 10:05.400
That can't be.

197
10:05.560 --> 10:07.360
Zhou Huan just sent me a message,

198
10:07.360 --> 10:08.360
saying he went out of town

199
10:08.360 --> 10:10.480
to help Huihui raise money and pull strings.

200
10:10.480 --> 10:12.240
Uncle, why don't you understand?

201
10:12.240 --> 10:13.600
He's putting on an act for you.

202
10:13.600 --> 10:15.720
He's just a pure scammer.

203
10:16.840 --> 10:19.840
Then how could Zhou Huan be like this?

204
10:21.240 --> 10:23.840
I guess he knew from the beginning

205
10:23.840 --> 10:25.840
that Anding Wealth Management was a scam company.

206
10:25.840 --> 10:28.120
So he got out before it blew up,

207
10:28.360 --> 10:30.220
leaving Huihui to take the blame.

208
10:31.360 --> 10:33.200
Then why did he still lead me to find

209
10:33.200 --> 10:34.040
a lawyer?

210
10:34.240 --> 10:36.000
He probably thought I was one of those

211
10:36.000 --> 10:37.480
small-time lawyers handing out cards at the hospital,

212
10:37.480 --> 10:38.640
definitely unreliable,

213
10:38.640 --> 10:40.440
and unable to see through his scam.

214
10:40.440 --> 10:41.370
He didn't expect

215
10:41.400 --> 10:42.880
me to keep holding onto this matter.

216
10:42.880 --> 10:44.040
So he came up with a trick

217
10:44.040 --> 10:45.640
to have you come make a scene here,

218
10:45.640 --> 10:47.040
so he could get away.

219
10:47.120 --> 10:48.160
Also, Uncle,

220
10:48.360 --> 10:49.400
Zhou Huan is now at

221
10:49.400 --> 10:51.280
a new wealth management company.

222
10:51.280 --> 10:53.520
So this was all planned by him.

223
10:56.600 --> 10:58.520
Brother, he is a scammer.

224
10:58.520 --> 10:59.560
Let's go find him.

225
11:00.000 --> 11:02.160
Uncle, we can't tip him off.

226
11:02.160 --> 11:03.880
Since he could go this far,

227
11:03.880 --> 11:05.480
it means he has thought of countermeasures.

228
11:05.480 --> 11:07.120
Even if we go, it's useless.

229
11:07.120 --> 11:08.480
He won't admit it.

230
11:08.520 --> 11:09.880
Then tell me, what should we

231
11:09.880 --> 11:11.280
do about this?

232
11:11.280 --> 11:13.760
Uncle, the trial is about to start.

233
11:13.880 --> 11:16.640
The most important thing is to get Yu Huihui to tell the truth.

234
11:16.640 --> 11:18.900
Only then can her punishment be reduced.

235
11:19.200 --> 11:20.280
Lawyer Xiao,

236
11:20.280 --> 11:22.040
I beg you again.

237
11:22.040 --> 11:23.160
You must think of a way.

238
11:23.160 --> 11:25.160
Please save my Huihui.

239
11:25.160 --> 11:25.640
Yes, Lawyer Xiao.

240
11:25.640 --> 11:26.640
We beg you.

241
11:26.720 --> 11:29.400
Don't worry, Uncle. I will definitely do my best.

242
11:29.400 --> 11:31.280
Thank you, Lawyer Xiao.

243
11:33.480 --> 11:36.080
Your husband told me everything about you two.

244
11:37.360 --> 11:38.360
About what?

245
11:38.400 --> 11:40.640
About what you did at Anding Wealth Management.

246
11:40.640 --> 11:43.480
He said he planned everything himself,

247
11:43.480 --> 11:45.010
including the 1.2 million.

248
11:45.160 --> 11:46.480
He also told you to transfer it,

249
11:46.480 --> 11:47.240
didn't he?

250
11:47.800 --> 11:49.480
He even told you that?

251
11:49.480 --> 11:50.480
And there's more.

252
11:50.880 --> 11:52.480
He said you two agreed

253
11:52.480 --> 11:53.560
not to return the stolen money.

254
11:53.560 --> 11:56.080
You'd take the blame, serve five years in prison,

255
11:56.080 --> 11:57.740
and then you two would be rich.

256
11:58.480 --> 11:59.480
Five years?

257
12:00.040 --> 12:02.240
Didn't my husband say two years?

258
12:02.520 --> 12:03.580
Strange, isn't it?

259
12:04.840 --> 12:06.760
Because Zhou Huan is lying to you.

260
12:10.160 --> 12:11.800
You don't have to look at me like that,

261
12:11.800 --> 12:12.520
Yu Huihui.

262
12:12.960 --> 12:15.680
As a professional lawyer, I'm telling you,

263
12:15.800 --> 12:18.000
if you don't return the stolen money under these circumstances,

264
12:18.000 --> 12:20.000
you'll face combined punishment for multiple crimes when the case reaches the procuratorate.

265
12:20.000 --> 12:22.060
Five years would be a light sentence.

266
12:23.400 --> 12:24.200
Impossible.

267
12:25.160 --> 12:27.800
Zhou Huan never intended to save you.

268
12:27.960 --> 12:30.320
He just wanted you to take the blame for him.

269
12:30.320 --> 12:32.400
He transferred that money away a long time ago.

270
12:32.400 --> 12:34.080
He won't wait for you to get out.

271
12:34.080 --> 12:34.680
Sis.

272
12:35.840 --> 12:37.040
No.

273
12:37.040 --> 12:39.280
My husband wouldn't do this to me.

274
12:39.360 --> 12:41.040
Your husband? Where is he?

275
12:41.240 --> 12:42.400
Are you two married?

276
12:43.480 --> 12:45.160
Your dad told me everything.

277
12:45.520 --> 12:47.040
You two aren't married.

278
12:47.280 --> 12:51.480
Zhou Huan kept saying he was too ashamed to marry you without buying a house.

279
12:51.520 --> 12:54.160
He used that as an excuse to keep delaying the wedding.

280
12:54.160 --> 12:56.160
Can't you see through his scheme?

281
12:56.400 --> 12:59.400
As long as this money isn't joint marital property...

282
12:59.400 --> 13:02.040
He could run away with the money at any time.

283
13:02.040 --> 13:03.280
That's impossible.

284
13:03.360 --> 13:05.680
Sister, you don't know him.

285
13:06.160 --> 13:07.480
He loves me very much.

286
13:08.280 --> 13:10.160
He said the first time he saw me,

287
13:10.480 --> 13:12.640
he felt I was the right one.

288
13:13.160 --> 13:14.880
He treats me so well.

289
13:15.040 --> 13:17.040
He doesn't even let me do housework.

290
13:18.040 --> 13:20.040
I'm not showing off.

291
13:21.040 --> 13:23.040
Even my toenails

292
13:23.880 --> 13:25.520
are cut by my husband.

293
13:25.880 --> 13:28.360
He's not just good to me.

294
13:28.520 --> 13:30.280
He's also very good to my dad.

295
13:30.640 --> 13:32.280
When my dad was in the hospital,

296
13:32.280 --> 13:35.280
he ran around and lost a lot of weight.

297
13:36.120 --> 13:37.640
You know, he's

298
13:38.120 --> 13:39.280
very pitiful.

299
13:39.560 --> 13:41.520
He grew up without parents.

300
13:41.720 --> 13:43.600
He really wants a family,

301
13:45.880 --> 13:47.080
and I can give him one.

302
13:47.120 --> 13:48.760
What can you give him?

303
13:48.760 --> 13:51.000
Why is he pitiful, Yu Huihui?

304
13:51.000 --> 13:53.130
Why do you believe everything he says?

305
13:54.520 --> 13:55.120
Sister.

306
13:57.040 --> 13:59.240
Have you ever truly loved someone?

307
14:04.880 --> 14:06.360
You definitely haven't.

308
14:06.880 --> 14:09.360
So you don't understand love.

309
14:09.520 --> 14:11.440
Love is about 100% trust.

310
14:11.440 --> 14:12.920
Am I wrong?

311
14:13.240 --> 14:16.240
Since his love for you is 100%

312
14:16.240 --> 14:17.120
and he trusts you,

313
14:17.120 --> 14:18.760
why are you the one sitting in here

314
14:18.760 --> 14:19.880
and not him?

315
14:20.120 --> 14:21.560
Since he loves you so much,

316
14:21.560 --> 14:24.240
why did he lie to you that it's two years instead of five?

317
14:24.240 --> 14:25.880
Why did he say your aunt is sick

318
14:25.880 --> 14:27.240
and can't return the stolen money?

319
14:27.240 --> 14:28.520
Why did he use that recording

320
14:28.520 --> 14:30.120
to fool your dad?

321
14:30.240 --> 14:31.880
Zhou Huan doesn't love you at all.

322
14:31.880 --> 14:33.760
He's just using you.

323
14:38.760 --> 14:40.880
No, that's definitely not true.

324
14:41.160 --> 14:42.760
My husband wouldn't treat me like this.

325
14:42.760 --> 14:44.160
Let's not talk about him.

326
14:44.240 --> 14:45.360
Let's talk about you.

327
14:45.360 --> 14:46.690
You might not know this,

328
14:47.320 --> 14:49.760
but your dad is so worried about you

329
14:49.880 --> 14:51.640
that his hair has turned white.

330
14:51.880 --> 14:54.880
Your aunt can't eat or sleep well,

331
14:55.120 --> 14:57.280
and she's going to get sick from worrying.

332
14:57.280 --> 14:58.880
Your whole family

333
14:58.880 --> 15:00.520
is so worried about you.

334
15:00.960 --> 15:03.240
Do you have the heart to see them like this?

335
15:03.240 --> 15:05.700
You just decided to go to jail for five years.

336
15:06.160 --> 15:07.520
Have you ever thought about it?

337
15:07.520 --> 15:08.520
After you go in,

338
15:08.520 --> 15:09.280
to put it bluntly,

339
15:09.280 --> 15:10.360
when you come out,

340
15:10.360 --> 15:12.220
will you still be able to see them?

341
15:14.440 --> 15:15.120
Yu Huihui.

342
15:16.760 --> 15:18.760
I might not be able to wake you up by scolding you.

343
15:18.760 --> 15:19.520
That's fine.

344
15:20.200 --> 15:21.530
But I want to remind you,

345
15:22.360 --> 15:25.090
this is the last time we'll meet before the trial.

346
15:26.040 --> 15:28.000
I hope you can think carefully

347
15:28.640 --> 15:30.240
about everything I've said.

348
15:31.000 --> 15:32.640
If you can tell the truth

349
15:32.640 --> 15:33.880
during the trial,

350
15:34.640 --> 15:37.370
your sentence could be reduced by more than half.

351
15:37.880 --> 15:39.000
Do you want to

352
15:39.000 --> 15:41.520
believe a man full of lies,

353
15:41.760 --> 15:44.360
or believe the truth and the law?

354
15:55.760 --> 15:58.000
Our profession looks glamorous.

355
15:58.240 --> 16:00.700
It's actually a high-end service industry.

356
16:00.840 --> 16:03.960
The core purpose is to serve the clients well.

357
16:04.640 --> 16:05.760
Right, Lawyer Li?

358
16:06.280 --> 16:07.000
Right.

359
16:07.360 --> 16:08.240
So,

360
16:09.000 --> 16:11.760
there's no need to complicate things.

361
16:12.000 --> 16:14.400
Since the client wants to plead not guilty,

362
16:15.120 --> 16:16.960
why are we fighting it, right?

363
16:17.120 --> 16:19.240
As long as you're on the same page as me,

364
16:19.240 --> 16:20.120
with this case,

365
16:20.320 --> 16:22.120
I can still bring you on board.

366
16:23.960 --> 16:25.200
Thank you, Lawyer Qiu.

367
16:25.200 --> 16:27.680
What do you plan to do next?

368
16:27.680 --> 16:28.400
And

369
16:29.160 --> 16:30.280
what can I do?

370
16:30.840 --> 16:31.720
Great.

371
16:32.240 --> 16:33.920
The local connections and relationships,

372
16:33.920 --> 16:35.000
you know them better than I do.

373
16:35.000 --> 16:36.600
But I know your personality.

374
16:36.680 --> 16:38.600
How about this: you make the introductions.

375
16:38.600 --> 16:39.680
Leave the communication to me.

376
16:39.680 --> 16:40.920
Let's work together.

377
16:43.680 --> 16:45.540
This is what Chairman Shao wants.

378
16:47.560 --> 16:49.920
I heard you just made senior partner.

379
16:50.160 --> 16:51.920
The performance pressure must be high, right?

380
16:51.920 --> 16:53.250
Broaden your thinking.

381
16:54.480 --> 16:55.200
Win-win.

382
16:56.920 --> 16:57.800
Understood.

383
16:58.400 --> 16:59.160
Win-win.

384
17:01.280 --> 17:01.920
Win-win.

385
17:04.200 --> 17:05.260
The coffee is good.

386
17:05.560 --> 17:08.680
Tastes a bit like Ethiopian Yirgacheffe.

387
17:09.599 --> 17:12.280
I can tell Attorney Qiu knows coffee.

388
17:12.280 --> 17:14.280
Right, because I'm not used to domestic brands.

389
17:14.280 --> 17:15.359
Nescafé instant.

390
17:16.880 --> 17:19.119
Imported Nescafé instant, right?

391
17:19.119 --> 17:20.160
Yes, imported.

392
17:20.520 --> 17:21.280
Please.

393
17:22.640 --> 17:24.240
Don't forget what I told you.

394
17:24.520 --> 17:25.280
Win-win.

395
17:26.160 --> 17:27.040
No need to see me out.

396
17:27.040 --> 17:28.440
Take care, Attorney Qiu.

397
17:34.280 --> 17:34.880
Director.

398
17:36.520 --> 17:37.360
I've figured it out.

399
17:37.360 --> 17:40.040
I've figured it out. It's a win-win.

400
17:44.640 --> 17:45.280
Lawyer Li.

401
17:45.640 --> 17:48.370
Your appointment at the detention center is set.

402
17:48.520 --> 17:49.160
Lawyer Li.

403
17:49.520 --> 17:51.200
Are you going to meet your client?

404
17:51.200 --> 17:52.160
Let me go with you.

405
17:52.160 --> 17:53.520
I can play good cop or bad cop.

406
17:53.520 --> 17:54.800
If push comes to shove, I'll even kneel down for him.

407
17:54.800 --> 17:56.000
No, no, no. You're too expensive.

408
17:56.000 --> 17:57.330
I'll kneel down for him.

409
17:59.560 --> 18:00.240
Lawyer Li, wait.

410
18:00.240 --> 18:02.370
The contract you asked for is printed.

411
18:07.600 --> 18:08.800
Did I read that wrong?

412
18:09.000 --> 18:10.360
Why is it a termination of representation?

413
18:10.360 --> 18:12.890
You didn't read it wrong. It is a termination.

414
18:13.120 --> 18:15.640
Do you think Lawyer Li has gone mad from anger?

415
18:15.640 --> 18:17.160
I don't know if he's angry.

416
18:17.760 --> 18:19.280
But he's definitely gone mad.

417
18:19.280 --> 18:21.040
When people are under a lot of pressure,

418
18:21.040 --> 18:22.360
they can do anything.

419
18:25.480 --> 18:26.880
Unbelievable.

420
18:38.000 --> 18:38.460
Leyang.

421
18:51.360 --> 18:53.000
Why did you come alone again?

422
18:53.160 --> 18:55.760
Didn't Lawyer Qiu make my intentions clear to you?

423
18:55.760 --> 18:56.960
He made it very clear.

424
18:57.520 --> 18:59.380
So this is the last time I'll come.

425
19:02.800 --> 19:03.730
What do you mean?

426
19:03.760 --> 19:04.720
Nothing.

427
19:05.200 --> 19:06.040
I'm quite busy too.

428
19:06.040 --> 19:07.640
Let's not waste each other's time.

429
19:07.640 --> 19:10.200
I explained the pros and cons clearly last time.

430
19:10.200 --> 19:12.600
I don't work with people who don't trust me.

431
19:19.000 --> 19:20.730
You're retreating to advance.

432
19:23.280 --> 19:24.040
Mr. Shao.

433
19:24.640 --> 19:27.080
I'll refund the legal fees in full. I won't keep a single cent.

434
19:27.080 --> 19:29.080
If there are no issues, just sign it.

435
19:34.320 --> 19:37.320
Aren't you afraid of getting a bad reputation if word gets out?

436
19:37.320 --> 19:40.120
Will anyone trust you in the future?

437
19:43.840 --> 19:45.040
Let me put it this way.

438
19:45.520 --> 19:48.120
Whether I take this case or not,

439
19:48.800 --> 19:50.560
win or lose,

440
19:50.840 --> 19:53.320
I'll still be a lawyer.

441
19:54.400 --> 19:55.660
But you're different.

442
19:58.360 --> 19:59.690
Are you threatening me?

443
20:00.080 --> 20:01.760
I never threaten anyone.

444
20:48.760 --> 20:49.620
Let me tell you.

445
20:50.000 --> 20:51.520
Let's get together after this is settled.

446
20:51.520 --> 20:52.880
You still have the nerve to come here.

447
20:52.880 --> 20:55.200
Aren't you afraid of being struck by lightning?

448
20:55.200 --> 20:56.260
Order in the court.

449
20:56.440 --> 20:57.970
What kind of person are you?

450
21:08.800 --> 21:10.330
The court is now in session.

451
21:10.480 --> 21:13.080
Summon the defendant, Yu Huihui, to the court.

452
21:15.000 --> 21:16.800
Huihui, Huihui.

453
21:19.640 --> 21:20.240
It's okay.

454
21:20.960 --> 21:21.680
I'm here.

455
21:29.560 --> 21:30.360
Don't worry.

456
21:35.320 --> 21:38.600
The defense counsel may now question the defendant.

457
21:39.120 --> 21:40.800
Yu Huihui, let me ask you.

458
21:40.960 --> 21:43.280
The 1.2 million mentioned by the prosecutor,

459
21:43.280 --> 21:45.280
how did you transfer it at that time?

460
21:46.360 --> 21:47.320
I just

461
21:49.160 --> 21:51.560
transferred it from the company's account

462
21:51.760 --> 21:53.840
to my bank card.

463
21:53.960 --> 21:55.960
Did you decide to do this yourself,

464
21:56.240 --> 21:58.500
or did your husband instruct you to do it?

465
21:58.520 --> 21:59.520
Defense counsel.

466
21:59.520 --> 22:01.760
The personal information of the defendant Yu Huihui shows...

467
22:01.760 --> 22:03.800
Her marital status is unmarried,

468
22:03.800 --> 22:04.520
yet you claim

469
22:04.520 --> 22:07.480
that Yu Huihui's actions were instigated by her husband.

470
22:07.480 --> 22:09.280
Please clarify what you mean.

471
22:10.040 --> 22:10.760
Your Honor,

472
22:11.520 --> 22:13.480
the defendant Yu Huihui is unmarried.

473
22:13.480 --> 22:15.720
Her so-called husband is just her boyfriend,

474
22:15.720 --> 22:17.760
who is sitting in the gallery,

475
22:18.040 --> 22:19.960
Zhou Huan, posing as a victim.

476
22:20.200 --> 22:22.960
Zhou Huan also used to work at Anding Wealth Management.

477
22:22.960 --> 22:23.960
During that time,

478
22:23.960 --> 22:26.760
he pursued my client, Yu Huihui,

479
22:26.800 --> 22:28.760
and they became a couple.

480
22:28.840 --> 22:31.480
Later, Zhou Huan resigned and hid behind the scenes,

481
22:31.480 --> 22:33.880
instigating Yu Huihui to embezzle the stolen money.

482
22:33.880 --> 22:36.720
When the stolen money was transferred to Yu Huihui's bank account,

483
22:36.720 --> 22:37.960
the very next day,

484
22:38.080 --> 22:39.760
Zhou Huan and Yu Huihui

485
22:39.920 --> 22:42.000
went to the bank together to withdraw cash.

486
22:42.000 --> 22:44.000
Please play the video for the court.

487
22:46.880 --> 22:49.280
Based on their relationship, it is reasonable to infer that

488
22:49.280 --> 22:50.760
after withdrawing the cash,

489
22:50.760 --> 22:52.760
the defendant handed the money over to Zhou Huan.

490
22:52.760 --> 22:55.280
Zhou Huan embezzled and hid it,

491
22:55.280 --> 22:58.080
and instructed Yu Huihui to take the blame for him.

492
22:58.080 --> 23:00.610
Your Honor, the prosecutor reminds the court

493
23:00.640 --> 23:03.320
that what the defense counsel said is entirely her personal speculation,

494
23:03.320 --> 23:04.680
unsupported by any evidence.

495
23:04.680 --> 23:05.480
Your Honor,

496
23:05.520 --> 23:08.280
please allow me to continue questioning my client.

497
23:08.280 --> 23:08.960
Granted.

498
23:09.040 --> 23:11.200
Yu Huihui, I ask you again,

499
23:11.200 --> 23:12.860
where is the stolen money now?

500
23:15.200 --> 23:16.760
Lawyer Xiao is asking you a question.

501
23:16.760 --> 23:17.960
Speak up.

502
23:17.960 --> 23:19.240
You're making me so anxious.

503
23:19.240 --> 23:20.280
Just tell the truth.

504
23:20.280 --> 23:21.080
Exactly.

505
23:21.800 --> 23:23.240
Order in the court.

506
23:23.280 --> 23:24.480
Keep quiet.

507
23:24.480 --> 23:26.140
Why do you keep looking at him?

508
23:36.280 --> 23:37.080
Huihui,

509
23:38.080 --> 23:39.480
I will always love you.

510
23:40.480 --> 23:41.920
Love you for a lifetime.

511
23:52.040 --> 23:53.520
I love you.

512
24:04.480 --> 24:05.560
I'm not sure.

513
24:05.560 --> 24:06.480
Defendant.

514
24:06.480 --> 24:07.280
Defendant Yu Huihui.

515
24:07.280 --> 24:07.360
Defendant.

516
24:07.360 --> 24:09.960
In front of your father and all your relatives.

517
24:10.040 --> 24:12.200
I hope you make a rational choice

518
24:12.240 --> 24:14.040
and tell the truth to the court.

519
24:14.200 --> 24:17.080
Does Zhou Huan have anything to do with this money?

520
24:26.960 --> 24:28.200
No, he doesn't.

521
24:31.080 --> 24:32.920
Yu Huihui, have you thought this through?

522
24:32.920 --> 24:35.240
Are you sure you want to trust this scammer,

523
24:35.240 --> 24:36.720
ignoring your elderly father

524
24:36.720 --> 24:38.480
and all the family members who care about you?

525
24:38.480 --> 24:39.440
Objection, Your Honor.

526
24:39.440 --> 24:41.640
The defender's question is irrelevant to the facts of the case.

527
24:41.640 --> 24:44.680
Defender, please focus your questions on the facts

528
24:44.680 --> 24:48.400
and evidence of this case.

529
24:54.680 --> 24:57.440
Yu Huihui, I will ask you one last time.

530
24:57.960 --> 25:01.480
From receiving the funds involved to the money disappearing,

531
25:02.440 --> 25:04.560
were you the only one handling it?

532
25:04.640 --> 25:08.800
Defendant.

533
25:08.800 --> 25:10.860
From beginning to end, it was only me.

534
25:11.720 --> 25:13.780
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

535
25:16.440 --> 25:17.300
I plead guilty.

536
25:18.560 --> 25:20.240
You are such a foolish child.

537
25:23.840 --> 25:25.320
Silence in the gallery.

538
25:32.240 --> 25:32.800
Bastard.

539
25:32.880 --> 25:34.010
Uncle, listen to me.

540
25:34.080 --> 25:35.800
I have always cared about Huihui.

541
25:35.800 --> 25:37.280
Otherwise, I wouldn't be here today.

542
25:37.280 --> 25:38.800
You came to threaten her.

543
25:38.920 --> 25:40.850
You are afraid she will turn you in.

544
25:40.920 --> 25:42.000
Do you think anyone is that stupid?

545
25:42.000 --> 25:43.320
You scumbag. Bastard.

546
25:43.320 --> 25:44.560
Have you no conscience?

547
25:44.560 --> 25:45.800
Aunt, Uncle.

548
25:45.800 --> 25:46.520
Yes.

549
25:47.120 --> 25:48.480
I understand how you feel.

550
25:48.480 --> 25:50.280
I am just as worried about Huihui as you are.

551
25:50.280 --> 25:51.600
You know how I treat her.

552
25:51.600 --> 25:53.320
You can't wrong an innocent person.

553
25:53.320 --> 25:55.000
Stop shedding crocodile tears here.

554
25:55.000 --> 25:56.200
Uncle, don't hit him.

555
25:56.800 --> 25:57.320
Come on.

556
25:57.320 --> 25:58.960
He didn't even touch you, and you're acting again.

557
25:58.960 --> 26:00.020
Are you hurt again?

558
26:00.360 --> 26:02.480
Lawyer Xiao, thank you for earlier.

559
26:02.640 --> 26:04.280
I thank you on behalf of Huihui.

560
26:04.280 --> 26:05.800
Why are you so addicted to acting?

561
26:05.800 --> 26:07.240
Are you still in character?

562
26:07.240 --> 26:08.400
You don't need to thank me.

563
26:08.400 --> 26:09.560
When you go to prison to serve your sentence,

564
26:09.560 --> 26:11.960
there will be plenty of time to write me a thank-you letter.

565
26:11.960 --> 26:12.560
Thank you.

566
26:12.720 --> 26:14.880
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

567
26:16.280 --> 26:17.280
Uncle.

568
26:17.280 --> 26:18.440
You bastard.

569
26:18.440 --> 26:19.700
We can't break the law.

570
26:19.760 --> 26:22.520
Lawyer Xiao, please save Huihui.

571
26:23.280 --> 26:24.520
My child is just foolish.

572
26:24.520 --> 26:26.320
She was deceived by that bastard.

573
26:26.320 --> 26:27.960
If you don't save her,

574
26:28.400 --> 26:31.000
she will have to go to jail.

575
26:31.520 --> 26:33.240
Uncle, please get up.

576
26:33.240 --> 26:33.960
Get up.

577
26:37.960 --> 26:39.000
Terminating the contract?

578
26:39.000 --> 26:40.800
Is this what you've figured out?

579
26:41.760 --> 26:43.360
The client doesn't trust me.

580
26:44.160 --> 26:47.820
I don't think it's necessary for me to continue representing him.

581
26:49.600 --> 26:51.000
If the client doesn't trust you,

582
26:51.000 --> 26:53.520
shouldn't you try your best to win his trust?

583
26:53.520 --> 26:54.280
Mentor.

584
26:55.200 --> 26:57.800
You can never wake up a person who is pretending to be asleep.

585
26:57.800 --> 26:59.000
And just like you said,

586
26:59.000 --> 27:00.120
this case is so big,

587
27:00.120 --> 27:01.360
and has drawn so much attention.

588
27:01.360 --> 27:03.360
If we continue to plead not guilty,

589
27:03.800 --> 27:06.000
we will really become a joke in court.

590
27:06.200 --> 27:07.680
That acting student doesn't care.

591
27:07.680 --> 27:08.520
Once the lawsuit is over,

592
27:08.520 --> 27:10.680
he'll catch a flight somewhere else to perform.

593
27:10.680 --> 27:13.280
He doesn't care at all about the verdict.

594
27:13.520 --> 27:14.850
But Honghu can't leave.

595
27:14.960 --> 27:17.560
We can't just do a one-time deal.

596
27:18.680 --> 27:20.810
Still, you shouldn't be so impulsive.

597
27:20.920 --> 27:23.380
Isn't there a more comprehensive solution?

598
27:25.240 --> 27:28.280
Your team already has three

599
27:28.320 --> 27:30.320
major clients about to sign

600
27:30.400 --> 27:32.960
who have asked to review the contracts again.

601
27:33.800 --> 27:34.930
These three clients

602
27:35.280 --> 27:37.520
are your biggest source of revenue this year.

603
27:37.520 --> 27:38.480
If you lose them,

604
27:38.680 --> 27:40.400
you won't meet the annual performance target,

605
27:40.400 --> 27:43.560
and you'll lose your senior partner position before you even settle in.

606
27:43.560 --> 27:45.420
Now that you're in this position,

607
27:45.480 --> 27:47.680
you need to consider the big picture:

608
27:47.920 --> 27:50.240
your team, your reputation,

609
27:50.600 --> 27:52.260
and your career development.

610
27:52.880 --> 27:54.480
You're a senior partner now.

611
27:54.840 --> 27:57.640
You need to be careful with your words and actions.

612
29:33.880 --> 29:35.800
This client really pissed me off.

613
29:35.800 --> 29:37.040
Drove me crazy.

614
29:37.480 --> 29:39.800
When I asked him, he swore to heaven,

615
29:39.800 --> 29:40.720
swore a solemn oath,

616
29:40.720 --> 29:42.450
that he never said those words.

617
29:42.560 --> 29:44.400
But guess what happened in court?

618
29:44.400 --> 29:45.920
The other side had a recording.

619
29:45.920 --> 29:47.560
I asked him, "Where did this recording come from?

620
29:47.560 --> 29:48.320
If you didn't say those words,

621
29:48.320 --> 29:49.160
where did the recording come from?"

622
29:49.160 --> 29:51.080
He said he was possessed by aliens.

623
29:51.080 --> 29:51.880
Isn't that hilarious?

624
29:51.880 --> 29:54.000
It's just unbelievable.

625
29:54.120 --> 29:54.640
That's why

626
29:54.640 --> 29:57.440
I say sometimes clients are only human at the time.

627
29:59.280 --> 30:00.640
Tell me something that makes you unhappy

628
30:00.640 --> 30:02.300
to make me feel better. Quick.

629
30:05.560 --> 30:07.720
I told my client the other day,

630
30:07.720 --> 30:08.960
"We have court tomorrow.

631
30:08.960 --> 30:10.080
Go to bed early tonight,

632
30:10.080 --> 30:11.960
because we have to be there early tomorrow morning."

633
30:11.960 --> 30:12.960
He said no, I can't get up.

634
30:12.960 --> 30:13.880
He told me to go negotiate.

635
30:13.880 --> 30:16.010
I said, how am I supposed to negotiate?

636
30:30.960 --> 30:32.760
I haven't even said I'm leaving.

637
30:33.160 --> 30:34.820
How come there's a new person?

638
30:34.920 --> 30:36.250
Isn't this your friend?

639
30:38.640 --> 30:39.280
Thanks.

640
30:45.720 --> 30:47.720
I like arranging them this way.

641
30:47.720 --> 30:49.440
It makes me comfortable.

642
30:49.480 --> 30:51.320
Who asked you to line them up for me?

643
30:51.320 --> 30:52.520
You look pretty upset.

644
30:52.520 --> 30:53.520
Drinking so much.

645
30:53.880 --> 30:55.280
Is the case not going well?

646
30:55.280 --> 30:56.800
Your case is the one not going well.

647
30:56.800 --> 30:58.000
It wasn't going well.

648
30:59.120 --> 31:00.120
But it's resolved.

649
31:00.120 --> 31:02.840
Stop pretending. What's resolved?

650
31:02.920 --> 31:04.760
You terminated the contract, right?

651
31:04.760 --> 31:06.000
I heard all about it.

652
31:07.360 --> 31:08.920
Classic Lawyer Li.

653
31:09.000 --> 31:12.330
Watching your client jump into a fire pit and doing nothing.

654
31:12.920 --> 31:14.160
Let go of the urge to help.

655
31:14.160 --> 31:15.560
Respect the fate of others.

656
31:15.560 --> 31:17.420
If the client can't see the truth,

657
31:17.800 --> 31:19.240
they have to pay the price.

658
31:19.240 --> 31:20.320
This is their karma.

659
31:20.320 --> 31:22.040
What are you talking about?

660
31:22.200 --> 31:24.720
Our profession as lawyers

661
31:24.720 --> 31:26.920
is to intervene in other people's karma.

662
31:26.920 --> 31:27.640
Yes.

663
31:27.760 --> 31:30.560
People must be responsible for what they've done.

664
31:30.760 --> 31:33.200
But why should he be responsible for what he hasn't done?

665
31:33.200 --> 31:36.240
This is the karma the law pursues.

666
31:36.280 --> 31:38.680
That scumbag did bad things,

667
31:38.680 --> 31:40.080
so he should be punished.

668
31:40.200 --> 31:40.760
Right?

669
31:40.760 --> 31:41.640
A scumbag?

670
31:41.920 --> 31:44.280
That's even less of a problem for a lawyer to solve.

671
31:44.280 --> 31:46.140
Why am I talking to you about this?

672
31:47.000 --> 31:48.440
Alright, stop drinking.

673
31:48.440 --> 31:49.570
Let me take you back.

674
31:50.000 --> 31:51.260
We've barely started.

675
31:55.640 --> 31:57.500
What are you doing? You scared me.

676
31:59.640 --> 32:00.440
Look.

677
32:00.640 --> 32:02.370
Zhou Huan went to a new company.

678
32:02.440 --> 32:04.240
He will definitely repeat his old tricks.

679
32:04.240 --> 32:06.000
As long as I get solid evidence,

680
32:06.640 --> 32:09.500
I don't believe Yu Huihui will still be so stubborn.

681
32:10.200 --> 32:11.640
I have to call Dong Beihu.

682
32:11.920 --> 32:13.240
You are really crazy.

683
32:13.240 --> 32:14.920
Calling a Siberian tiger?

684
32:14.920 --> 32:16.200
Isn't that an animal?

685
32:59.160 --> 33:01.480
Xin, you know we run a bathhouse ourselves.

686
33:01.480 --> 33:03.160
Why did you come here and waste money?

687
33:03.160 --> 33:05.000
What kind of place is yours, and what kind of place is this?

688
33:05.000 --> 33:06.640
Are the baths the same?

689
33:06.640 --> 33:07.200
Right.

690
33:07.480 --> 33:11.000
A man needs to know how to make money and enjoy life.

691
33:11.520 --> 33:13.380
That's why you're a superior man.

692
33:38.920 --> 33:40.040
What are you dawdling for?

693
33:40.040 --> 33:40.720
Well.

694
33:41.040 --> 33:42.760
I'm wearing a bit too much.

695
33:46.200 --> 33:46.920
Don't move.

696
33:48.000 --> 33:48.800
What's wrong?

697
34:03.920 --> 34:05.000
You've got a white hair.

698
34:05.000 --> 34:06.440
Just pull it out.

699
34:06.680 --> 34:07.240
Let's go.

700
34:07.440 --> 34:08.440
It's true.

701
34:09.159 --> 34:10.199
Time makes us old.

702
34:10.639 --> 34:12.170
Let's hurry and take a bath.

703
34:17.239 --> 34:19.920
I've recently realized

704
34:20.480 --> 34:23.159
that you're different from the old Dong Beihu.

705
34:23.159 --> 34:25.920
You know how to be modest and low-profile.

706
34:25.920 --> 34:26.679
Yes.

707
34:26.719 --> 34:29.520
And you truly want to learn from me.

708
34:29.920 --> 34:31.239
I'm absolutely sincere.

709
34:31.239 --> 34:32.000
Xin.

710
34:32.000 --> 34:33.239
Recently,

711
34:34.199 --> 34:35.920
I've gotten to know you all over again.

712
34:35.920 --> 34:36.719
In the past,

713
34:36.719 --> 34:39.239
I treated you as a good brother and a good boss.

714
34:39.239 --> 34:41.159
Now you're my life mentor.

715
34:41.440 --> 34:43.199
Isn't there a famous saying?

716
34:43.480 --> 34:46.719
A teacher for a day is a teacher for a lifetime.

717
34:47.000 --> 34:47.929
You startled me.

718
34:48.320 --> 34:49.760
I thought you were going to mess up our seniority.

719
34:49.760 --> 34:50.760
Could I be that stupid?

720
34:50.760 --> 34:52.090
Here, drink some water.

721
34:54.199 --> 34:55.719
I'm happy today.

722
34:55.920 --> 34:57.440
Let's not beat around the bush.

723
34:57.440 --> 35:00.000
Just tell me, which path should I lead you on?

724
35:01.160 --> 35:02.640
Look, there's no one here today.

725
35:02.640 --> 35:04.040
I'll tell you the truth.

726
35:04.920 --> 35:07.600
I just want to know about the connections

727
35:07.600 --> 35:08.480
that got me out.

728
35:09.440 --> 35:11.040
I figured maybe in the future,

729
35:11.040 --> 35:12.240
someone will ask me for help.

730
35:12.240 --> 35:13.640
Look, I can help people

731
35:13.640 --> 35:15.770
and make some money. How great is that?

732
35:16.760 --> 35:17.760
Make what money?

733
35:18.480 --> 35:19.440
Make what money?

734
35:20.680 --> 35:21.480
I can make money from others.

735
35:21.480 --> 35:23.160
How could I make money from you?

736
35:23.160 --> 35:24.160
As for your matter,

737
35:24.160 --> 35:26.640
I did it specially for you.

738
35:26.760 --> 35:28.160
I stopped doing that kind of work a long time ago.

739
35:28.160 --> 35:29.640
The 200,000 your mom gave me,

740
35:29.640 --> 35:31.170
I didn't keep a single cent.

741
35:40.320 --> 35:41.240
No, no, no.

742
35:41.760 --> 35:43.360
I'm too excited. Xin.

743
35:43.640 --> 35:45.760
I really didn't expect you to be such a good friend.

744
35:45.760 --> 35:48.240
You didn't keep a single cent of the 200,000, right?

745
35:48.240 --> 35:48.760
Knowing you,

746
35:48.760 --> 35:50.360
I must have accumulated good karma for eight lifetimes.

747
35:50.360 --> 35:51.160
Xin, really.

748
35:51.520 --> 35:52.380
You flatter me.

749
35:58.240 --> 36:00.120
Hadouken.

750
36:02.120 --> 36:03.120
This kid.

751
36:05.480 --> 36:08.720
The phone is ringing. Life is getting better.

752
36:08.880 --> 36:10.760
I've been calling you all day. Why didn't you answer?

753
36:10.760 --> 36:11.890
I need to talk to you.

754
36:12.040 --> 36:13.520
I need to talk to you too.

755
36:13.520 --> 36:14.240
About what?

756
36:17.520 --> 36:18.200
Evidence.

757
36:18.920 --> 36:20.640
Evidence of that bastard Jia Xin's crimes.

758
36:20.640 --> 36:21.360
I got it on tape.

759
36:21.360 --> 36:22.760
I can call the police now.

760
36:24.080 --> 36:25.600
With such great news,

761
36:25.600 --> 36:27.120
shouldn't we celebrate?

762
36:28.600 --> 36:29.330
That's true.

763
36:29.560 --> 36:31.420
Let's go. I'll treat you to a meal.

764
36:31.760 --> 36:33.720
Come on. I should be thanking you for this.

765
36:33.720 --> 36:34.920
I should be the one treating you.

766
36:34.920 --> 36:36.560
I... I'll treat you.

767
36:36.560 --> 36:37.840
But... but if you insist on treating,

768
36:37.840 --> 36:38.640
that's fine too.

769
36:38.640 --> 36:39.500
Okay. Let's go.

770
36:39.720 --> 36:41.180
You're too enthusiastic.

771
36:46.920 --> 36:48.520
What does it mean to endure hardships?

772
36:48.520 --> 36:51.760
What does it mean to never return until Loulan is defeated?

773
36:51.760 --> 36:54.800
What does it mean to never return until Loulan is defeated?

774
36:54.800 --> 36:56.200
It's an ancient poem.

775
36:57.960 --> 37:00.560
Never return until Loulan is defeated, right?

776
37:00.720 --> 37:02.840
You're so educated, Brother Hu.

777
37:03.200 --> 37:04.400
I have to say, Brother Hu,

778
37:04.400 --> 37:06.480
you have both courage and strategy.

779
37:06.480 --> 37:08.040
You are truly brave and wise.

780
37:08.040 --> 37:09.240
A role model for our generation.

781
37:09.240 --> 37:11.970
These are just the tip of the iceberg of my merits.

782
37:13.240 --> 37:13.840
Let me tell you.

783
37:13.840 --> 37:15.240
You can't even imagine

784
37:15.360 --> 37:17.000
how those bastards bossed me around.

785
37:17.000 --> 37:19.280
They used all sorts of dirty tricks.

786
37:19.280 --> 37:20.120
I only had one move.

787
37:20.120 --> 37:22.240
Countering every move they made.

788
37:22.440 --> 37:24.480
Fortunately, I'm a versatile talent.

789
37:24.480 --> 37:26.000
I handled all the work.

790
37:26.000 --> 37:27.000
If you ask me,

791
37:27.000 --> 37:29.520
it has to be a versatile talent like you, Brother Hu, right?

792
37:29.520 --> 37:30.440
You can adapt to any situation.

793
37:30.440 --> 37:31.700
No one else could do it.

794
37:33.840 --> 37:34.960
Then you should continue working tomorrow.

795
37:34.960 --> 37:35.840
No problem.

796
37:37.560 --> 37:38.360
Wait a minute.

797
37:38.880 --> 37:41.410
What are you talking about? Why should I work?

798
37:41.800 --> 37:43.680
You've handled Jia Xin, right?

799
37:44.040 --> 37:44.800
What about Zhou Huan?

800
37:44.800 --> 37:45.960
You have to step in too.

801
37:45.960 --> 37:48.020
What does Zhou Huan have to do with me?

802
37:51.320 --> 37:53.200
You're impossible to guard against.

803
37:53.200 --> 37:55.520
I was wondering why you were so kind to treat me to a meal.

804
37:55.520 --> 37:56.920
You were doing it for your own case all along.

805
37:56.920 --> 37:57.520
No.

806
37:57.520 --> 38:00.080
I thought such a small matter would be

807
38:00.080 --> 38:01.640
a piece of cake for you, Brother Hu.

808
38:01.640 --> 38:03.570
You can easily turn things around.

809
38:03.640 --> 38:05.760
If you go, won't you take them all down at once?

810
38:05.760 --> 38:07.200
Don't flatter me.

811
38:07.680 --> 38:09.680
Do you really think I'm stupid?

812
38:09.680 --> 38:10.600
If I show off again,

813
38:10.600 --> 38:12.080
I'll blow that 200,000.

814
38:12.160 --> 38:13.200
I'm definitely not going.

815
38:13.200 --> 38:14.530
What about the 180,000?

816
38:15.240 --> 38:17.160
The 180,000 is still in there.

817
38:17.160 --> 38:18.160
Don't you want it?

818
38:18.760 --> 38:19.720
My 180,000...

819
38:19.720 --> 38:21.040
I'll just go there tomorrow

820
38:21.040 --> 38:21.560
and tell him

821
38:21.560 --> 38:23.560
to withdraw it for me, and that's it.

822
38:23.960 --> 38:25.240
You're too naive, Brother Hu.

823
38:25.240 --> 38:26.480
Do you think it's a bank?

824
38:26.480 --> 38:28.160
It's a scam company.

825
38:28.160 --> 38:30.760
Do you think you can withdraw it just like that?

826
38:30.880 --> 38:31.740
Think about it.

827
38:32.600 --> 38:33.960
Did the chickens used for these roasted chicken frames

828
38:33.960 --> 38:35.800
practice bodybuilding before they died?

829
38:35.800 --> 38:37.720
My teeth hurt so much from the meat stuck in them.

830
38:37.720 --> 38:39.960
Then you should pay more attention to your health.

831
38:39.960 --> 38:40.890
What do you mean?

832
38:40.960 --> 38:43.960
Do you know why people check a donkey's teeth when buying it?

833
38:43.960 --> 38:45.820
To check its physical condition.

834
38:48.120 --> 38:49.720
Who are you calling a donkey?

835
38:50.000 --> 38:51.600
You think you're so healthy?

836
38:51.640 --> 38:53.320
Your teeth are like a blender.

837
38:53.320 --> 38:55.120
You can even chew bones, right?

838
38:55.120 --> 38:56.720
It doesn't relieve my anger.

839
38:56.800 --> 38:58.800
Why are you so mad at Xiaoxin?

840
38:58.800 --> 39:01.280
Even criminals can hire lawyers.

841
39:01.280 --> 39:02.800
This is common legal knowledge that even I know.

842
39:02.800 --> 39:04.120
But he is a policeman's son.

843
39:04.120 --> 39:05.200
And you are a lawyer's father.

844
39:05.200 --> 39:06.160
Don't you know that?

845
39:06.160 --> 39:06.920
Look at me.

846
39:06.920 --> 39:09.600
I totally understand and support Xiaolong.

847
39:14.360 --> 39:14.890
Lao Xiao.

848
39:16.400 --> 39:17.600
Isn't that Xiaolong?

849
39:18.040 --> 39:18.960
Who's that guy?

850
39:21.040 --> 39:22.440
Think about it, Brother Hu.

851
39:22.440 --> 39:25.640
Are you the only one scammed by this fraudulent company?

852
39:25.640 --> 39:27.720
There must be many other victims.

853
39:28.120 --> 39:30.000
When you make a move,

854
39:30.000 --> 39:31.460
you can take them all down.

855
39:32.360 --> 39:34.960
You won't just be the hero of Sister Pang's Bathhouse,

856
39:34.960 --> 39:36.840
or the hero of our law firm.

857
39:36.840 --> 39:39.640
You'll be the great hero of the entire Leyang City!

858
39:39.640 --> 39:42.760
You'll be upholding justice and eliminating evil for the people.

859
39:42.760 --> 39:43.480
Forget about eliminating evil.

860
39:43.480 --> 39:45.400
I'll just try not to be the evil.

861
39:45.400 --> 39:46.840
Don't worry, I definitely won't go.

862
39:46.840 --> 39:48.170
I... I can't do this job.

863
39:48.840 --> 39:50.900
I find you a bit stubborn, Brother Hu.

864
39:51.200 --> 39:52.320
Something got in my eye.

865
39:52.320 --> 39:53.480
No, no, don't rub it.

866
39:53.480 --> 39:54.280
Don't rub it.

867
39:57.840 --> 39:59.240
Come on, one, two, three.

868
40:04.200 --> 40:05.320
Slow down.

869
40:06.160 --> 40:08.840
No, since when did they become a thing?

870
40:09.320 --> 40:10.760
How would I know?

871
40:11.400 --> 40:12.320
Alright.

872
40:12.880 --> 40:13.760
Don't touch it.

873
40:13.840 --> 40:15.040
Your hands are dirty.

874
40:16.680 --> 40:17.840
This is my eyeball.

875
40:17.840 --> 40:19.080
Are you blowing it like a birthday candle?

876
40:19.080 --> 40:20.410
Did you just make a wish?

877
40:20.800 --> 40:22.400
No. Does Xiaoxin know about this?

878
40:22.400 --> 40:23.960
How would I know?

879
40:28.600 --> 40:30.320
Think about it carefully.

880
40:30.360 --> 40:31.480
Stop talking nonsense, okay?

881
40:31.480 --> 40:32.360
Whoever wants to do it can do it.

882
40:32.360 --> 40:33.800
I can't do this, you know?

883
40:33.840 --> 40:34.800
I'm out of here.

884
40:44.960 --> 40:47.440
This kid dares to show attitude to Xiaolong.

885
40:47.440 --> 40:48.640
Give it a rest.

886
40:49.840 --> 40:51.920
Based on my years of police experience,

887
40:51.920 --> 40:53.920
that kid looks like a little punk.

888
40:53.920 --> 40:54.920
After so many years in the underworld,

889
40:54.920 --> 40:56.320
do you think I can't tell?

890
40:56.320 --> 40:56.800
I'm telling you, Old Li.

891
40:56.800 --> 40:57.360
This won't work.

892
40:57.360 --> 40:58.440
We have to step in.

893
40:59.080 --> 41:01.160
We must make Xiaoxin and Xiaolong make up.

894
41:01.160 --> 41:02.280
We can't let them have a falling out,

895
41:02.280 --> 41:03.280
or this kid will pop up

896
41:03.280 --> 41:04.440
and take advantage of the situation.

897
41:04.440 --> 41:05.640
Absolutely not.

898
41:05.720 --> 41:06.920
Absolutely not.

899
41:19.640 --> 41:21.200
I'm really speechless.

900
41:21.440 --> 41:22.720
For this case I have on hand,

901
41:22.720 --> 41:24.640
I've been busy for months.

902
41:25.080 --> 41:26.400
The client heard from somewhere

903
41:26.400 --> 41:28.280
that our team is just a bunch of pretty faces,

904
41:28.280 --> 41:29.880
and then terminated the contract with me.

905
41:29.880 --> 41:32.810
Lawyer Li might feel good terminating the contract,

906
41:32.960 --> 41:34.880
but our performance is gone too, isn't it?

907
41:34.880 --> 41:36.540
The client doesn't trust you.

908
41:37.200 --> 41:38.720
You should learn from Lawyer Li's mindset.

909
41:38.720 --> 41:39.560
Learn what?

910
41:39.560 --> 41:41.480
Learn how to terminate a contract with a client?

911
41:41.480 --> 41:42.040
Didn't I just learn that?

912
41:42.040 --> 41:43.840
I learned it, but what's the use?

913
41:43.840 --> 41:44.680
Here you go.

914
41:51.320 --> 41:52.580
You should get one too.

915
41:52.840 --> 41:53.900
Are you kidding me?

916
41:54.320 --> 41:55.850
Is the Shanyuan case ready?

917
41:56.000 --> 41:57.240
Just finished sorting it out.

918
41:57.240 --> 41:57.640
Good.

919
41:58.160 --> 41:58.760
Lawyer Li.

920
41:59.840 --> 42:01.770
I heard that for the Shanyuan case,

921
42:02.000 --> 42:04.080
Lawyer Shen's team also wants to fight for it.

922
42:04.080 --> 42:06.200
And Lawyer Shen has already privately

923
42:06.200 --> 42:07.400
met with President Fan of Shanyuan

924
42:07.400 --> 42:08.860
for drinks several times.

925
42:09.280 --> 42:11.560
I was thinking if we could learn from it.

926
42:11.600 --> 42:13.200
Learn what? Drinking?

927
42:13.840 --> 42:14.680
We are all just pretty faces.

928
42:14.680 --> 42:15.810
We can't learn this.

929
42:20.640 --> 42:22.040
You should learn from it.

930
42:25.600 --> 42:26.640
I heard you.

931
42:31.400 --> 42:33.640
Aren't I just looking out for our team?

932
42:33.880 --> 42:35.920
Isn't this treating my kindness like dirt?

933
42:35.920 --> 42:36.680
If this continues,

934
42:36.680 --> 42:37.940
our team will be ruined

935
42:38.240 --> 42:39.240
and we'll have to disband.

936
42:39.240 --> 42:40.840
Then you should find a new one quickly.

937
42:40.840 --> 42:42.280
Am I that kind of person?

938
42:48.080 --> 42:48.920
Lawyer Qiu.

939
42:56.040 --> 42:57.040
Where is your Lawyer Li?
